### ⭐ Suggestion

Allow to define classes like this:

```ts
class Currency extends String<"USD" | "EUR"> {
  static parse(value: string): Currency {
    if (value === "USD" || value === "EUR") {
      return value;
    } else {
      throw new Error("Invalid currency");
    }
  }
}
const currency = new Currency("USD");
```

